WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.736
In the Northern Song there was a statesman who was also a great writer: Fan Zhongyan.

00:00:06.086 --> 00:00:10.814
In his youth he studied hard, always carrying the people of the world in his heart.

00:00:11.164 --> 00:00:16.684
He cared about the affairs of the state, and once went to the frontier to guard the land and protect the people.

00:00:17.034 --> 00:00:21.978
The soldiers and people at the frontier deeply respected him.

00:00:22.328 --> 00:00:27.152
He promoted reforms, hoping the country would become richer and stronger.

00:00:27.502 --> 00:00:33.238
In his Record of the Yueyang Tower, he wrote a famous line that would last through the ages.

00:00:33.588 --> 00:00:38.844
Worry about the world's worries before the world does; enjoy the world's joys only after the world does.

00:00:39.194 --> 00:00:44.618
The line means: be the first to worry for the people of the world, and the last to rejoice with them.

00:00:44.968 --> 00:00:51.616
This line expressed his ideal of loving his country and its people, and it has been passed down for a thousand years.

00:00:51.966 --> 00:00:56.166
Reading this line today, people are still deeply moved.

